completed_at: "2026-08-03T13:47:52.763Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
acceptance_criteria: "A test asserts the blank-line skip directly, both for a header-only payload and for a blank line between two entries; branch coverage for model.ts no longer depends on any other test file; the full gate reports 100 percent on lines, branches and functions on both matrix legs"
parent: pm-vcs-tr2a
close_reason: Pinned with direct assertions on a header-only payload and a blank line between two entries. Coverage back to 100/100/100 locally; CI to confirm on both matrix legs.
